+  2->3 MsgApp Term:2 Log:1/4 Commit:4 Entries:[2/5 EntryNormal ""]
+> 3 receiving messages
+  2->3 MsgApp Term:2 Log:1/4 Commit:4 Entries:[2/5 EntryNormal ""]
+  DEBUG 3 [logterm: 0, index: 4] rejected MsgApp [logterm: 1, index: 4] from 2
+> 3 handling Ready
