+  Messages:
+  1->2 MsgSnap Term:1 Log:0/0 Snapshot: Index:4 Term:1 ConfState:Voters:[1 2] VotersOutgoing:[1] Learners:[] LearnersNext:[] AutoLeave:true
+> 2 receiving messages
